{"sourceUrl":"https://som.xjtu.edu.cn/info/1123/13033.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:46.711464+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://som.xjtu.edu.cn/info/1123/13033.htm","html":"<div>\n\n\n<div>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为了做好</span> 2026 年推荐免试研究生（以下简称推免生）招生工作，根据教育部相关文件和《西安交通大学2026年推荐免试研究生招生章程》（西交研〔2025〕119号），</span><span><span>我院制定本工作实施细则。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>招</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>收条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>符合学校推免生招生章程的基本条件，且</span></span><span><span>满足下列条件者</span></span><span><span>:</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1、“双一流”建设高校及学科，具有理工类、经济类、管理类专业背景的</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2、学习成绩优异，本科前五学期总评成绩排名在专业前15%；（注：在科研、竞赛等方面有优异表现者，如已在重要学术期刊上发表论文、获得国际级或国家级竞赛奖项、获双学位等，上述排名要求可适当放宽）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3、英语水平优秀，通过英语六级或其他社会认可度较高的英语水平测试成绩；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4、有志于从事学术研究，有较强的或潜在的研究能力（</span></span><span><span>以攻读博士学位为目标</span></span><span><span>的硕博贯通型研究生和</span></span><span><span>直博生</span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5、诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>学校推免服务系统报名</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span> 1、报名时间：</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>9:00</span></span><span>--9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>9:00</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>报名网址：</span></span><a href=\"http://yzbm.xjtu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>http://yzbm.xjtu.edu.cn</span></span></a><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>学生登录该页面，选择推免生报名，注册登录系统，查看报名通知及相关须知。</span></span><strong><span><span>报名信息需填写完整、准确，</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>推免生应对所有报名信息仔细核对，</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>材料提交不齐的学生视为放弃报名资格，材料</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>一经提交将无法更改。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>①《西安交通大学</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>接收推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）学位申请表</span></span><span><span>》（在</span><span>“上传材料”步骤下载后，由本人及所在院系负责人签字后与其他材料一并上传）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>②截至目前的本科阶段成绩单</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份及本专业排名证明</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份（两份文件均需加盖学校或者院系教务部门公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>③英语水平证明材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>④</span></span><span><span>其他材料，包括：获奖证书，发表或者能体现自身学术水平的学术论文、出版物等；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>⑤</span></span><span><span>科研计划书（附件一</span></span><span><span>,申请会计专硕的学生无需提交此份资料</span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>⑥</span></span><span><span>推荐书两份</span></span><span><span>（附件二，仅申请直博的学生需提供此项资料，一位推荐人为本校博士生导师，一位推荐人需为西安交通大学管理学院博士生导师，导师招生目录详见</span>https://yzbm.xjtu.edu.cn/zsml/bszsml/detailtm/bfo8@yEtRpW1EyxsEKg7eQ==）</span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>学院审核报名信息后，满足条件者学院将在</span><span>9月</span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span>:00</span></span><span><span>后</span></span><span><span>发送复试通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>、推免生收到复试通知后须在</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>小时之</span></span><span><span>内</span></span><span><span>需在报名系统内</span></span><span><span>确认接收复试通知</span></span><span><span>,参加</span></span><span><span>西安</span></span><span><span>线下复试，</span></span><span><span>否则视为放弃。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>复试安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1、复试资格</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>1）参加本院</span><span><span>7月活动</span></span><span><span>并获得</span></span><span><span>A类</span></span><span><span>资格</span></span><span><span>的推免生</span></span><span><span>务必在</span></span><span>9月</span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>12:00</span></span><span><span>前在系统中完成注册</span></span><span><span>和报名流程，否则视为放弃。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>2）</span><span><span>可获得推免资格及其他</span></span><span><span>参加</span></span><span><span>7月活动B类学生</span></span><span><span>均</span></span><span><span>可</span></span><span><span>参加</span></span><span><span>本次学校推免系统</span></span><span><span>报名，资格审核通过后按照复试通知参加复</span></span><span><span>试考核。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2、复试形式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试以线下面试形式进行。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3、复试内容及时间</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）面试时间：2025年9月16日和17日，具体面试时间及分组安排另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）面试内容：专业知识、科研能力、综合素质、英语表达能力等</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4、凡参加学校推免系统报名的推免生，均须参加综合素质测试，综合素质测试时间为</span></span><strong><span><span>9月13日-15日，具体安排详见附件四。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>预接收</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1、复试</span><span><span>结束</span></span><span><span>后</span></span><span><span>，学院</span></span><span><span>将发送拟录取、预录取及不录取</span></span><span><span>通知，申请人</span></span><span><span>须在预接收通知发出</span><span>8小时内确认是否接受，否则视为放弃。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2、拟录取的学生，</span></span><span><span>待教育部推免服务系统开通后</span></span><span><span>学院将优先录取，预录取为拟录取递补方式，拟录取学生如有放弃，由预录取学生顺位递补。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、全国推免管理服务系统接收</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>9月22日9</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span>00，申请我院的</span></span><span><span>学生</span></span><span><span>须在</span><span>“全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”开通后</span></span><strong><span><span>1小时内</span></span></strong><span><span>按要求提交志愿信息；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>9月23日9</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span>00，我院开始发送复试通知，</span></span><span><span>学生</span></span><span><span>须在</span></span><strong><span><span>1小时内</span></span></strong><span><span>接收复试通知，对于已在我校推免阶段预接收的推免生，不再组织考核；其他</span></span><span><span>未参加我校</span></span><span><span>预推免</span></span><span><span>的推免生，仍可在教育部推免服务系统开放后申报我院推免生，</span></span><span><span>我院资格审核通过后，将第一时间通知线上复试；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>9月25日9:00，我院开始发送拟录取通知，</span></span><strong><span><span>学生须在</span><span>9月25日14:00第一时间确认拟录取通知，并于15分钟内接收拟录取</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>。</span></span></strong><span><span>所有报名我院相关专业的推免生需及时关注相关通知，保持电话畅通，在</span></span><span><span>推免服务</span></span><span><span>系统</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>规定时间</span></span><span><span>内</span></span><span><span>完成</span></span><span><span>接收程序，否则名额将顺延</span></span><span><span>，未按规定时间接受拟录取者，视为放弃我院拟录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>   六、拟录取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>   1、</span></span><span><span>请</span></span><span><span>已经获得预接收资格</span></span><span><span>的推免生，</span></span><span><span>务必</span></span><span><span>按细则要求时间完成报名、录取，否则将被取消优先录取资格，与未获得预接收资格推免生同等对待。请及时关注发送的复试、拟录取通知并</span></span><span><span>第一时间</span></span><span><span>进行确认。</span></span><span><span>申请者应对报考信息仔细核对，一经提交</span></span><span><span>，将无法更改</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   <span><span>2、我院在学校下达的推免招生计划范围内，对所有申报我院的推免生，按如下顺序分批次录取，额满为止。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>本校</span></span><span><span>拟录取</span></span><span><span>学生：</span><span>9月2</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span>:30前完成系统拟录取工作；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>外校</span></span><span><span>拟录取学生：</span><span>9月2</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>:30前完成系统拟录取工作；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>预</span></span><span><span>录取推免生：截止</span><span>9月2</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>:00，上述推免生如有放弃，将从该批学生中递补完成拟录取工作，录满为止。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>七、录取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>拟录取推免生经学校招生工作领导小组审定，并经省级招生主管部门审核通过，在学校研究生招生信息网予以公示，拟录取推免生获得学校</span><span>2026年免试攻读硕士或博士学位研究生录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>八、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>奖助政策</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我校硕士研究生奖助金体系包括国家奖学金、国家助学金、学业奖学金、社会奖助金和</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>三助一辅</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>岗位津贴以及临时困难补助和绿色通道等。推免的硕士研究生享受硕士奖助金，推免的直博生享受博士奖助金。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学校统筹评定国家奖学金、学业奖学金、社会奖助金。获得国家奖学金的研究生当年不得享受学业奖学金。社会奖助金依据设奖人的意愿进行奖励，可以与国家奖学金或者学业奖学金兼得。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>详情请查阅我校研究生院主页（</span></span><a href=\"https://som.xjtu.edu.cn/info/1123/13033.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>http://gs.xjtu.edu.cn</span></span></a><span><span>）相关文件。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>九、其他事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>   1</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>录取通知书及入学相关材料与</span> <span>2026年全国统考研究生一并发放。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   2</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>按照学校培养方案规定，录取为学术型研究生</span></span><span><span>的学生（直博生除外）按硕博贯通模式培养（详见西交研〔</span><span>2017〕93号文件）；录取为专业型研究生的学生按协同育人模式培养（详见西交研〔2017〕30号文件）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   3</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>专项计划（强基计划、辅导员、支教团等）根据上级部门要求执行，学校根据工作安排另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   4</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>已被我院接收的推荐免试生，应承诺不再列入</span> <span>2026年本科就业计划，不再次报名参加当年硕士招生考试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   5</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>已被我院接收的推荐免试生，如在入学前未获得学士学位或思想政治素质与品德考核不合格将被取消录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>   6</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>如发现推免生报考信息弄虚作假、违反招生规定、存在品德失范、学术不端或违法违纪违规等情况的，经相关部门查证属实，学校将按照相关规定取消其申请资格、录取资格或入学资格等，并通报申请人所在学校，产生的一切后果由本人负责。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>   <span><span>7</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>学校按照《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》（教学〔</span><span>2003〕3号）要求，结合招生专业实际情况组织体检，具体安排另行通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>   <span><span>8</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>未尽事宜由学院招收推免生工作小组负责解释。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>十、联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>邮箱</span><span>（学硕、直博）</span><span>：</span><a href=\"https://som.xjtu.edu.cn/info/1123/13033.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>liangwei0131@mail.xjtu.edu.cn</span></a></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>029-82668949</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>邮箱（会计专硕）：</span><span>fengting@xjtu.edu.cn</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话</span><span>:</span></span><span><span>029-82663676</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>十一、监督和申诉</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>考生在招生过程中有异议的，</span></span><span><span>请</span></span><span><span>实名</span></span><span><span>提起申诉，渠道如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>邮箱</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>jdsom@xjtu,edu.cn</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>附件一：科研计划书</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>附件二：推荐书</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>附件三：个人诚信承诺</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>附件四：</span></span><span><span>西安交通大学学生综合素质测评说明</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><strong><span><strong><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></strong></span></strong></span></strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n\n</div>","textSha256":"c14eb320761e0623cb6a2409112c461b0539ffba4fb5e0604ae51be9a76ace00","textLength":2995,"sourceSha256":"5d6c4d4c5f2404aee82ca5393d3325bd0b3e05ebcbaf045d1f60aa87bbbd4e90","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件一：科研计划书.doc","url":"https://som.xjtu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=2027089175&wbfileid=16638702"},{"name":"附件二：推荐书.docx","url":"https://som.xjtu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=2027089175&wbfileid=16638703"},{"name":"附件三：个人诚信承诺书.docx","url":"https://som.xjtu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=2027089175&wbfileid=16638704"},{"name":"附件四：西安交通大学学生综合素质测评说明.docx","url":"https://som.xjtu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=2027089175&wbfileid=16638705"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7127934df4fee677c3a8","title":"2025年西安交通大学管理学院2026年推荐免试研究生招生工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:46.711464+00:00"}
